This License does not permit SaaS, multi-tenant software, a hosted website builder, subscription website platform, reseller platform, multi-customer CMS, white-label hosted CMS service, or any platform through which multiple customers manage separate websites. Such use requires a separately negotiated written SaaS or Extended Commercial License; no terms for either are granted here.

