10. SUPPORT AND EXTENDED SUPPORT ADD-ON
Standard support is not included. The product includes its files, installation/administrator/configuration documentation, changelog, published security notices, and update access under section 9. It excludes personal installation, hosting/server administration, domain/DNS/SMTP configuration, custom development, content entry, redesign, migration, extensive debugging of Buyer-modified code, third-party service support, emergency service, and guaranteed response time.

A separately purchased Extended Support Add-on lasts six months from its purchase or activation. It includes reasonable help with confirmed product defects, official documentation clarification, standard installation/configuration guidance, and included-version features. It excludes custom or new-feature development, hosting/server/domain/DNS/email administration, content migration/entry, redesign, extensive debugging of modified code, third-party failures, emergency response, and guaranteed resolution unless separately agreed in writing. It may be renewed by purchasing another support period. It is not an Extended License.

